Error: Jet.RunParameterNotCli: `run`'s parameter isn't a CLI-derived type
  --> Tests/UI/retired_cli_marker.jet:6:15
    |
  6 | run: fn(args: Args) {
    |               ^^^^
 Why: A typed `run: fn(args: T)` entry only works when `T` is a `#CLI`-derived program struct.
 Fix: Mark the program struct `#CLI`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.RunParameterNotCli

Error: Jet.UnknownAppliedRule: `#Cli` isn't a known applied rule
  --> Tests/UI/retired_cli_marker.jet:1:2
    |
  1 | #Cli
    |  ^^^
 Why: `Cli` isn't registered as an applied rule — Jet rules are a closed, registered vocabulary, not any PascalCase word.
 Fix: Did you mean `#CLI`?
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnknownAppliedRule
